{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます！！ Rottyだよ.まにだよ."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが大好きガトーショコラ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とカフェラテ.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洒落なカフェを見つけちゃいました.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗くて いっぱい綺麗なライトが...＊\n癒されます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真を撮ってくれた相手は、\n私の親友さん. 宮沢セイラだよぉぉ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん\n幸せそうな笑顔してるね*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして告知です！！！\n有難いことに、、『乃木坂46SHOW!』乃木團でます！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録済みです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私，『命は美しい』にも出ます。\nBSだよ！是非見てくださいねん。♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして2日前には乃木坂では初のイベント『クルージング』がありましたヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた皆さん 本当にありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"船酔いしてる ずーとちー。笑\nあみが間に入ってなんかしてる 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外は暗くて画質荒いね*\\(^o^)/*\nまにと畠中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんとも撮ったんだけど、\n画質悪いはブレてるはだから載せるやめときます（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーを抜いたteam「D」【ずーは船酔い中】"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/15/8020291/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も楽しくいきましょー☺️✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし。まに。"}],"source":"archive"}